# Booking widget. Copy to .env.local for development, and set the same key in
# your host's environment settings (Vercel, Netlify, ...) for production.
#
# Must be https in production: a browser blocks an http:// script on an
# https:// page as mixed content, without a visible error.
#
# The booking server must also name the site's origin in its `frame-ancestors`
# CSP header, or the browser refuses to frame the widget. The match is exact -
# https://innertheory.co and https://www.innertheory.co are different origins.
#
# Left unset in a production build, the Book now button falls back to the
# on-page consult form rather than pointing visitors at a dead host.
VITE_BOOKING_EMBED_URL=https://booking.example.com/embed.js?token=theory-website
